I want people to love their
game the way I love it,

00:23:03.980 --> 00:23:06.850
not get the accolades
or success that I have.

00:23:06.850 --> 00:23:10.260
'Cause the happiness is way
more fun than the byproduct.

00:23:10.260 --> 00:23:12.150
And I know a ton of people

00:23:12.150 --> 00:23:15.530
who are unbelievably happy

00:23:15.530 --> 00:23:18.000
and make $49,000 a year

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:20.180
and I know an enormous amount of people

00:23:20.180 --> 00:23:23.070
who are deeply unhappy and sick

00:23:23.070 --> 00:23:25.720
who make $7 million a year.

00:23:25.720 --> 00:23:27.590
And something I've been saying a lot

00:23:27.590 --> 00:23:29.680
and I wanna say more often,

00:23:29.680 --> 00:23:32.530
there was always that joke
that people talked about

00:23:34.450 --> 00:23:36.640
around always valuing money

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:40.593
and they talked about I'd
rather cry in my Ferrari.

00:23:42.560 --> 00:23:45.430
That saying always pissed me off.

00:23:45.430 --> 00:23:48.620
This notion that okay, you're crying,

00:23:48.620 --> 00:23:50.720
you're deeply unhappy.

00:23:50.720 --> 00:23:53.370
And the Ferrari verses a Toyota

00:23:53.370 --> 00:23:55.730
is suppose to be some
sort of variable there.

00:23:55.730 --> 00:23:58.343
It's such insane bad talk.

00:23:59.460 --> 00:24:03.123
Everybody should aspire to
be smiling in their Toyota.

00:24:04.180 --> 00:24:07.560
If you find out and understand yourself

00:24:07.560 --> 00:24:10.070
and you've put yourself
in the best position

00:24:10.070 --> 00:24:11.400
and you happen to have talent

00:24:11.400 --> 00:24:14.170
and you put in a
ridiculous amount of work,

00:24:14.170 --> 00:24:16.570
then you might be able
to smile in your Ferrari.

00:24:17.870 --> 00:24:20.210
And that's amazing too

00:24:20.210 --> 00:24:23.480
but these are the things that
are running through my head

00:24:23.480 --> 00:24:25.260
and I appreciate you
having me here tonight.

00:24:25.260 --> 00:24:26.320
Thank you.

00:24:26.320 --> 00:24:31.320
(audience applauds)
(audience cheers)

00:24:32.670 --> 00:24:33.770
So, let's do some Q&amp;A.

00:24:34.810 --> 00:24:35.730
Who's got a question?

00:24:35.730 --> 00:24:36.563
Yes, ma'am.

00:24:36.563 --> 00:24:37.690
Stand up and ask away.

00:24:37.690 --> 00:24:38.523
Oh you have a mic.

00:24:38.523 --> 00:24:39.356
Nice.

00:24:39.356 --> 00:24:40.320
Gonna try to play a little bit?

00:24:40.320 --> 00:24:41.715
Yeah, we'll do the best we can.

00:24:41.715 --> 00:24:42.759
- [Male Event Staff Member ]
Are we gonna get this one on?

00:24:42.759 --> 00:24:43.592
- [Female Event Staff Member] Yes.

00:24:43.592 --> 00:24:44.425
