time but there's not.

00:31:56.050 --> 00:31:56.883
You're in your 20s.

00:31:56.883 --> 00:31:57.930
You have all these good years

00:31:57.930 --> 00:31:58.827
and it's really like I'm 23,

00:31:58.827 --> 00:32:00.530
