00:32:00.530 --> 00:32:01.673
They're fuckin' good.

00:32:02.716 --> 00:32:05.716
(audience applauds)

00:32:09.250 --> 00:32:10.083
I get it.

00:32:10.083 --> 00:32:10.916
I get it.

00:32:10.916 --> 00:32:11.749
And you'll appreciate this.

00:32:11.749 --> 00:32:12.582
And I'm glad we did this.

00:32:12.582 --> 00:32:14.483
That's why I talk about patience.

00:32:15.410 --> 00:32:16.243
You know?

00:32:16.243 --> 00:32:17.190
Because what you're actually saying

00:32:17.190 --> 00:32:18.310
is you're impatient.

00:32:18.310 --> 00:32:19.143
And that's okay.

00:32:19.143 --> 00:32:20.230
- No, no, I'm not.

00:32:20.230 --> 00:32:21.308
- Okay.

00:32:21.308 --> 00:32:23.260
(audience laughs)
You are.

00:32:23.260 --> 00:32:24.191
But that's okay.

00:32:24.191 --> 00:32:25.700
Go ahead.
